[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=21 format=3]

; Package 8 A1 - the single shared UI Theme.
;
; Every colour here is a named constant in scripts/UI/UIPalette.cs and
; UIThemeTests pins the two together, so the palette cannot drift from what the
; theme actually paints. Screens adopt this by setting Theme on their root
; Control; Godot propagates it down the subtree.
;
; No font resource is referenced on purpose. assets/fonts/ is empty, so the
; theme must work against Godot's built-in default font and simply pick up a
; production face later by adding default_font here. Sizes are set, faces are
; not.

